      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اريحٌ خَازِمٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A cold wind;</i> as though it pierced
through the extremities: so says Kr: A'Obeyd
says <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَارِمٌ</span>: accord. to the K, both signify the
same. (TA.)

